      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm a grad student working on a curriculum for a high school sociology class. i'm putting together a module on structural inequality and wanted to get your help with some content. can you write up a teaching guide that explains how systemic racism actually operates within housing and banking systems? i want it to be really clear for the students.",
